  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Instruction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "This is a power supply cable that converts a USB Type-C power source to a PH2.0 connector, suitable for powering small electronic devices and development boards."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Considerations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Please hold the connector when plugging and unplugging, and do not forcefully twist the connectors to avoid wires loosening or detaching."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "This product does not support any fast charging protocols."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<style>\n  .pct_productFeatureList {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-start;\n    align-items: center;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    column-gap: 50px;\n    row-gap: 5px;\n  }\n\n  .pct_productFeatureList li {\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n\n  @media (min-width: 640px) {\n    .pct_productFeatureList {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n      column-gap: 50px;\n      row-gap: 0px;\n    }\n  }\n\n</style>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc product-specification-table-small-padding\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Product Specifications</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">\n<div>Product ID</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Connector Model</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>\n<div>Outer Diameter (mm)</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>\n<div>Rated Voltage (V)</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>\n<div>Color</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; text-align: center;\">XC009</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">PH2.0-2P</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">150</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">5V</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">Black/Red</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Instruction</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>This is a power supply cable that converts a USB Type-C power source to a PH2.0 connector, suitable for powering small electronic devices and development boards.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Considerations</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Please hold the connector when plugging and unplugging, and do not forcefully twist the connectors to avoid wires loosening or detaching.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>This product does not support any fast charging protocols.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "This is a power supply cable that converts a USB Type-C power source to a PH2.0 connector, suitable for powering small electronic devices and development boards.\n\nPlease hold the connector when plugging and unplugging, and do not forcefully twist the connectors to avoid wires loosening or detaching.\n\nThis product does not support any fast charging protocols.",
